1
00:00:02,055 --> 00:00:03,339
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,489
raise both arms

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:07,083
controlling his arm
take a deep step forward,

4
00:00:07,384 --> 00:00:08,748
cutting down in front of you,

5
00:00:09,149 --> 00:00:11,143
as you do so slide across

6
00:00:11,144 --> 00:00:13,262
bring Uke down completely in front of you,

7
00:00:13,663 --> 00:00:18,563
with his arm slightly above 90°
place down in front of you for the pin.

